{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114505","id":3141009228,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc67N_9M","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114505","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114505.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/114505.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114505","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114505/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/114505/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114505/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/ef0163ba9ff3ccd8490608afe5bfb344fdc7397b","number":114505,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Add support for picture-in-picture","user":{"login":"m4gr3d","id":914968,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkxNDk2OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/914968?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d","html_url":"https://github.com/m4gr3d","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m4gr3d/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"This PR adds support for [picture-in-picture](https://developer.android.com/design/ui/mobile/guides/home-screen/picture-in-picture) allowing a Godot application to be moved to a small window pinned to one of the screen corners.\r\nThis can be done explicitly via `DisplayServer#pip_mode_enter()` or configured to happen automatically via `DisplayServer#pip_mode_set_auto_enter_on_background(...)` when the application is placed in the background, the latter capability allowing for background playback.\r\n\r\nPartially addresses https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/3347 for Android.\r\n\r\n**Note:**\r\nUsers cannot directly interact with an application in picture-in-picture mode so the feature is most useful for apps and games that have sections that require little to no interactivity. E.g:\r\n- media players\r\n- games with sections showing cinematic contents, i.e: picture-in-picture can be enabled when the game starts showing cinematic contents and disabled when returning to interactive contents\r\n\r\n\r\n**Example usage**:\r\nApps can check for the feature availability before explicitly triggering it:\r\n```\r\nfunc _enter_pip_mode():\r\n    if DisplayServer.has_feature(DisplayServer.FEATURE_PIP_MODE):\r\n        # Configure the aspect ratio, or omit this call to keep the default\r\n        DisplayServer.pip_mode_set_aspect_ratio(1, 1)\r\n        DisplayServer.pip_mode_enter()\r\n```\r\n\r\nApps can configure the system to automatically put them in PiP mode when placed in the background:\r\n```\r\nfunc _enable_pip_mode_on_background():\r\n    if DisplayServer.has_feature(DisplayServer.FEATURE_PIP_MODE):\r\n        DisplayServer.pip_mode_set_aspect_ratio(16, 9)\r\n        DisplayServer.pip_mode_set_auto_enter_on_background(true)\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe `NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_PAUSED` notification is still emitted when the application goes in PiP mode, the app can use `DisplayServer.is_in_pip_mode()` to check whether the app is in PiP mode and not pause its logic. \r\nThe `NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_PIP_MODE_ENTERED` and `NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_PIP_MODE_EXITED` can also be used to detect when the application enters / exits PiP mode.\r\n```\r\nfunc _notification(what):\r\n    if what == NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_PAUSED:\r\n        if DisplayServer.is_in_pip_mode():\r\n            # Don't pause the logic\r\n        else:\r\n            # Pause the logic\r\n\r\n    if what == NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_PIP_MODE_ENTERED:\r\n        # Update UI for PiP mode\r\n    elif what == NOTIFICATION_APPLICATION_PIP_MODE_EXITED:\r\n        # Revert UI back to normal\r\n```\r\n\r\nHere's a recording of a quick integration of the new APIs with the [Rift Riff game](https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.adriaandejongh.riftriff), where PiP mode is only enabled during one of the game's wave.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ccbcf886-7a6e-4bae-8baa-3636e9c6ca27\r\n\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://contributing.godotengine.org/en/latest/engine/guidelines/code_style.html\r\n-->\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279097562,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTc1NjI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:android","name":"platform:android","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":14236899,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A2Tzj","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/god